Inspiration

ArchiLite's feature set was informed by CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft),
which is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. As of this release, ArchiLite contains no code,
assets or text copied or adapted from CADCraft. If any is adapted in future, the affected
files will carry a header naming the source, and the adaptation will be listed here with the
upstream copyright notice: "Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the CADCraft contributors".

Third-party material

ArchiLite currently ships no third-party runtime code, fonts, icons or images. The user
interface uses the operating system's own fonts. Development tools (used to build and test,
not shipped) are listed in package-lock.json and are checked by scripts/license-gate.mjs.
Every shipped asset and dependency is listed in ATTRIBUTION.md.
